OL,3,GNEWSADisappointment over bonfire night
OL,4,Acancellation
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors have expressed their
OL,7,Fdisappointment over the cancellation of
OL,8,Fa bonfire night and fireworks event.
OL,10,FThe event, which was due to be held in
OL,11,FTruro and expected to attract up to
OL,12,F5,000 people, was cancelled for the
OL,13,Fsecond year in a row.
OL,15,FThis year's celebrations were cancelled
OL,16,Fafter organisers said it could not be
OL,17,Fheld safely within the available
OL,18,Fbudget.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
