OL,3,GNEWSADisappointment over bonfire night
OL,4,Acancellation
OL,5,
OL,6,FMayor of Truro Chris Wells said: "It is
OL,7,Fobviously disappointing that we could
OL,8,Fnot stage this important community
OL,9,Fevent this year."
